## Digibot Character Flow Summary
```
Per Frame:
  Digibot::updatePreRender()
    └─ Prepares interpolated visuals

Input Processing:
  DigibotPlayerController::update()
    ├─ Captures keyboard/mouse input
    ├─ Sends to Digibot (movement, roll, view direction)
    └─ Positions camera

Physics Callbacks:
  DigibotPlayerController::onPhysicsUpdateComplete()
    └─ Handles lock raycasting

Physics Update:
  Digibot::updatePhysicsComplete()
    └─ DigibotController::updatePhysicsComplete()
       └─ Applies forces based on inputs